WEBVTT

00:03:28.547 --> 00:03:30.664
koji vas čisto fore radi
zovu "luzerom".

00:03:30.688 --> 00:03:32.593
Dira me u dušu.

00:03:32.617 --> 00:03:34.825
Al' sad doma radimo
nešto drugačije,

00:03:34.849 --> 00:03:36.750
imamo jam sessione,

00:03:36.774 --> 00:03:41.008
i naši jam sessioni su
improvizacije -- u crkvi.

00:03:41.032 --> 00:03:43.465
Kužite, u crkvi,
pogledali bi se ovako,

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:44.640
(Beatboxanje)

00:03:44.664 --> 00:03:45.665
(Smijeh)

00:03:45.689 --> 00:03:47.527
i SMS-ali bi si ritmove.

00:03:48.018 --> 00:03:50.387
Ili bi kuhali u kuhinji,

00:03:50.411 --> 00:03:52.214
putovanja, aerodromi.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:55.964
NP: Stajali tako u kutu,
"Aa, tata -- poslušaj ovo."

00:03:55.988 --> 00:03:57.176
(Beatboxanje)

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.185
Nee, šalim se. Al znate što?

00:03:59.852 --> 00:04:03.055
Pričamo o svim tim
jam sessionima i svemu.